      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name} at the present moment I don't have the current FBX that was giving me issues as I renamed the bones to fix the problem\n\nhowever this could also be related to a different issue I posted about currently being tracked, at the time of making the avatar I was still using test avatars, not aware that test avatars are currently broken, it could be that upon runtime the bones got mixed up, or the constraint just didn't work for that reason, from what I remember though, selecting the bone in unity would select the incorrect bone, but I cant fully remember for sure\n\nfor the other issue in question reference this https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1482-test-avatars-break-constraints",
